yle=\"--rv-delay:0ms\"><figure class=\"relative\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] border hairline\"><img src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/15865451/pexels-photo-15865451.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=627&amp;w=1200\" alt=\"A couple laughing and embracing in a sunlit wheat field\" class=\"kenburns h-[340px] w-full object-cover sm:h-[420px]\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div><figcaption class=\"mt-4 flex items-center gap-3 text-[12px] tracking-wide text-ash\"><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-gold/60\"></span>Sunday, somewhere between the garden and the market.</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"order-1 lg:order-2\"><div class=\"rv \" style=\"--rv-delay:0ms\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">The manifesto</p><h2 class=\"mt-5 font-display text-[clamp(2rem,4.2vw,3.4rem)] font-semibold leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.02em] text-pearl\">A calmer room for<!-- --> <em class=\"font-medium italic text-gold-soft\">serious hearts.</em></h2></div><div class=\"rv \" style=\"--rv-delay:140ms\"><p class=\"mt-7 text-[16px] leading-[1.8] text-mist\">Most dating apps reward reflexes — a stack, a swipe, a half-second verdict on a face. Freeborn was built on the opposite bet: that the things which actually hold two lives together deserve room on the first screen. How you live. How you heal. What you want to build, and with what kind of patience.</p><p class=\"mt-5 text-[16px] leading-[1.8] text-mist\">This is a space for people who believe health choices are personal, natural wellness matters, and relationships should be built with honesty, respect, and long-term direction — without turning a first conversation into a debate.</p></div><div class=\"rv \" style=\"--rv-delay:240ms\"><p class=\"mt-9 border-l-2 border-ember/60 pl-5 font-display text-[22px] italic leading-snug text-ivory\">“Date like you mean it.”</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"how\" class=\"relative border-t hairline bg-gradient-to-b from-night to-midnight/40\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-14 px-5 py-28 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] lg:gap-24 lg:py-36\"><div class=\"lg:sticky lg:top-32 lg:self-start\"><div class=\"rv \" style=\"--rv-delay:0ms\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">How it works</p><h2 class=\"mt-5 font-display text-[clamp(2rem,4.2vw,3.4rem)] font-semibold leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.02em] text-pearl\">Chemistry,<!-- --> <em class=\"font-medium italic text-gold-soft\">with context.</em></h2><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-md text-[16px] leading-[1.8] text-mist\">Four deliberate steps instead of an endless feed. Freeborn is built around deciding with context — not reacting to a stack.</p></div><div class=\"rv \" style=\"--rv-delay:160ms\"><div class=\"mt-10 hidden items-center gap-1.5 lg:flex\"><span class=\"h-[3px] rounded-full transition-all duration-700 w-10 bg-ember\"></span><span class=\"h-[3px] rounded-full transition-all duration-700 w-6 bg-pearl/15\"></span><span class=\"h-[3px] rounded-full transition-all duration-700 w-6 bg-pearl/15\"></span><span class=\"h-[3px] rounded-full transition-all duration-700 w-6 bg-pearl/15\"></span><span class=\"ml-3 font-display text-sm italic text-sand\">01<!-- --> / 04</span></div></div></div><div><div data-step=\"0\" class=\"step-row is-active\"><div class=\"rv px-6 py-10 sm:px-8 lg:py-12\" style=\"--rv-delay:0ms\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-6\"><span class=\"font-display text-[44px] font-medium leading-none transition-colors duration-700 text-ember\">01</span><div><h3 class=\"font-display text-[22px] font-semibold tracking-tight text-pearl\">Build a values-aligned profile</h3><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-lg text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-mist\">Share your essentials, health rhythm, lifestyle, relationship direction, interests, and a short bio. It is designed to feel human before it feels searchable.</p></div></div></div></div><div data-step=\"1\" class=\"step-row \"><div class=\"rv px-6 py-10 sm:px-8 lg:py-12\" style=\"--rv-delay:60ms\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-6\"><span class=\"font-display text-[44px] font-medium leading-none transition-colors duration-700 text-pearl/20\">02</span><div><h3 class=\"font-display text-[22px] font-semibold tracking-tight text-pearl\">Set your boundaries</h3><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-lg text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-mist\">Choose who you want to see, how far discovery should reach, and whether deal breakers should be strict. Clarity is part of chemistry.</p></div></div></div></div><div data-step=\"2\" class=\"step-row \"><div class=\"rv px-6 py-10 sm:px-8 lg:py-12\" style=\"--rv-delay:120ms\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-6\"><span class=\"font-display text-[44px] font-medium leading-none transition-colors duration-700 text-pearl/20\">03</span><div><h3 class=\"font-display text-[22px] font-semibold tracking-tight text-pearl\">Read the whole person</h3><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-lg text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-mist\">Profiles put location, intention, words, interests, photos, wellness cues, and verification status in one calm view — so every choice has context.</p></div></div></div></div><div data-step=\"3\" class=\"step-row \"><div class=\"rv px-6 py-10 sm:px-8 lg:py-12\" style=\"--rv-delay:180ms\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-6\"><span class=\"font-display text-[44px] font-medium leading-none transition-colors duration-700 text-pearl/20\">04</span><div><h3 class=\"font-display text-[22px] font-semibold tracking-tight text-pearl\">Move toward something real</h3><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-lg text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-mist\">When a like becomes mutual, the conversation begins with values already on the table — not a blank performance of small talk.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"standard\" class=\"relative border-t hairline\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-28 sm:px-8 lg:py-36\"><div class=\"rv max-w-2xl\" style=\"--rv-delay:0ms\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">The Freeborn standard</p><h2 class=\"mt-5 font-display text-[clamp(2rem,4.2vw,3.4rem)] font-semibold leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.02em] text-pearl\">Three commitments,<!-- --> <em class=\"font-medium italic text-gold-soft\">kept in code.</em></h2><p class=\"mt-6 text-[16px] leading-[1.8] text-mist\">Not slogans on a landing page — product decisions. Every one of these shapes what you can share, what stays private, and how discovery feels.</p></div><div class=\"mt-16\"><div class=\"rv \" style=\"--rv-delay:0ms\"><div class=\"group grid gap-4 border-t hairline py-10 transition-all duration-500 hover:bg-pearl/[0.02] sm:grid-cols-[110px_1fr] sm:gap-8 lg:py-12\"><span class=\"font-display text-[15px] italic text-ash transition-all duration-500 group-hover:text-ember\">(<!-- -->01<!-- -->)</span><div class=\"transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-1.5\"><h3 class=\"font-display text-[clamp(1.4rem,2.4vw,1.9rem)] font-semibold tracking-tight text-pearl\">Values before volume</h3><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-3xl text-[15px] leading-[1.8] text-mist\">Freeborn is built for people who want health autonomy, natural living, faith or philosophy, family direction, and long-term intentions to have room in the dating experience — without turning a profile into a debate.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"rv \" style=\"--rv-delay:90ms\"><div class=\"group grid gap-4 border-t hairline py-10 transition-all duration-500 hover:bg-pearl/[0.02] sm:grid-cols-[110px_1fr] sm:gap-8 lg:py-12\"><span class=\"font-display text-[15px] italic text-ash transition-all duration-500 group-hover:text-ember\">(<!-- -->02<!-- -->)</span><div class=\"transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-1.5\"><h3 class=\"font-display text-[clamp(1.4rem,2.4vw,1.9rem)] font-semibold tracking-tight text-pearl\">Natural health belongs in compatibility</h3><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-3xl text-[15px] leading-[1.8] text-mist\">Lifestyle, wellness rhythm, informed choice, and medical freedom can shape daily life. Freeborn gives members a respectful way to share those values early, so connection starts with context.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"rv \" style=\"--rv-delay:180ms\"><div class=\"group grid gap-4 border-t hairline py-10 transition-all duration-500 hover:bg-pearl/[0.02] sm:grid-cols-[110px_1fr] sm:gap-8 lg:py-12\"><span class=\"font-display text-[15px] italic text-ash transition-all duration-500 group-hover:text-ember\">(<!-- -->03<!-- -->)</span><div class=\"transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-1.5\"><h3 class=\"font-display text-[clamp(1.4rem,2.4vw,1.9rem)] font-semibold tracking-tight text-pearl\">Trust without overexposure</h3><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-3xl text-[15px] leading-[1.8] text-mist\">Age-gated onboarding, private birth dates, editable discovery settings, visible verification status, and clear profile completeness cues help the room feel accountable — while personal essentials stay private.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"border-t hairline\"></div></div></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden border-t hairline bg-void/60\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 h-[420px] w-[900px] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(closest-side, rgba(217,167,82,0.09), transparent 70%)\"></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 lg:py-24\"><div class=\"rv \" style=\"--rv-delay:0ms\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-center\">The trust ledger</p><p class=\"mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-center text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-mist\">No invented match rates. No borrowed press logos. These are the rules the product actually ships with.</p></div><div class=\"mt-14 grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-[24px] border hairline bg-pearl/[0.06] sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"rv bg-night\" style=\"--rv-delay:0ms\"><div class=\"flex h-full flex-col justify-between px-7 py-9 transition-colors duration-500 hover:bg-midnight\"><span class=\"font-display text-[56px] font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight text-pearl\">18+</span><span class=\"mt-6 block text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-sand\">age-gated membership before discovery opens</span></div></div><div class=\"rv bg-night\" style=\"--rv-delay:80ms\"><div class=\"flex h-full flex-col justify-between px-7 py-9 transition-colors duration-500 hover:bg-midnight\"><span class=\"font-display text-[56px] font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight text-pearl\">6</span><span class=\"mt-6 block text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-sand\">profile photos maximum, keeping presentation intentional</span></div></div><div class=\"rv bg-night\" style=\"--rv-delay:160ms\"><div class=\"flex h-full flex-col justify-between px-7 py-9 transition-colors duration-500 hover:bg-midnight\"><span class=\"font-display text-[56px] font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight text-pearl\">3</span><span class=\"mt-6 block text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-sand\">relationship intentions highlighted on each profile</span></div></div><div class=\"rv bg-night\" style=\"--rv-delay:240ms\"><div class=\"flex h-full flex-col justify-between px-7 py-9 transition-colors duration-500 hover:bg-midnight\"><span class=\"font-display text-[56px] font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight text-pearl\">0</span><span class=\"mt-6 block text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-sand\">birth dates, emails, or account providers shown publicly</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"safety\" class=\"relative border-t hairline bg-gradient-to-b from-night via-midnight/30 to-night\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-28 sm:px-8 lg:py-36\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.85fr_1.15fr] lg:gap-20\"><div class=\"rv lg:sticky lg:top-32 lg:self-start\" style=\"--rv-delay:0ms\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Safety &amp; privacy</p><h2 class=\"mt-5 font-display text-[clamp(2rem,4.2vw,3.4rem)] font-semibold leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.02em] text-pearl\">Trust is a<!-- --> <em class=\"font-medium italic text-gold-soft\">design decision.</em></h2><p class=\"mt-6 text-[16px] leading-[1.8] text-mist\">We don&#x27;t ask you to trust a promise — we show you the controls. Every safety choice below is visible, editable, and enforced in the product, not just on this page.</p><a href=\"/auth?mode=sign-up\" class=\"btn-ghost mt-8 inline-flex rounded-full px-6 py-3 text-[14px] font-bold\">Create your account</a></div><div class=\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"rv sm:col-span-2\" style=\"--rv-delay:0ms\"><div class=\"group h-full rounded-[22px] border hairline bg-abyss/60 p-7 transition-all duration-500 hover:border-ember/30 hover:bg-abyss\"><div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border hairline bg-night transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:-translate-y-1\"><svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 26 26\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13 2.5c5 3.4 8 7.6 8 12a8 8 0 11-16 0c0-4.4 3-8.6 8-12z\" stroke=\"#d9a752\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M13 8v12M13 12.5l3.4-2.6M13 16l-3.4-2.6\" stroke=\"#4fb8a7\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-5 font-display text-[19px] font-semibold tracking-tight text-pearl\">Health autonomy respected</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[14px] leading-[1.75] text-mist\">Freeborn is for people who believe medical decisions and wellness practices deserve informed consent, personal agency, and respectful conversation — never coercion or ridicule.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv \" style=\"--rv-delay:80ms\"><div class=\"group h-full rounded-[22px] border hairline bg-abyss/60 p-7 transition-all duration-500 hover:border-ember/30 hover:bg-abyss\"><div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border hairline bg-night transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:-translate-y-1\"><svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 26 26\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"5\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" stroke=\"#d9a752\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"></rect><circle cx=\"9.2\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2.4\" stroke=\"#4fb8a7\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"></circle><path d=\"M5.6 18.2c.7-1.7 2-2.6 3.6-2.6s2.9.9 3.6 2.6M15.5 10h4.8M15.5 13.5h4.8M15.5 17h3\" stroke=\"#d9a752\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-5 font-display text-[19px] font-semibold tracking-tight text-pearl\">Age-gated entry</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[14px] leading-[1.75] text-mist\">Date of birth is required to confirm 18+ eligibility, then kept private from public profiles.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv \" style=\"--rv-delay:160ms\"><div class=\"group h-full rounded-[22px] border hairline bg-abyss/60 p-7 transition-all duration-500 hover:border-ember/30 hover:bg-abyss\"><div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border hairline bg-night transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:-translate-y-1\"><svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 26 26\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"11\" width=\"16\" height=\"11\" rx=\"3\" stroke=\"#d9a752\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"></rect><path d=\"M8.5 11V8.4a4.5 4.5 0 019 0V11\" stroke=\"#d9a752\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><circle cx=\"13\" cy=\"16\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"#4fb8a7\"></circle><path d=\"M13 17.4v1.8\" stroke=\"#4fb8a7\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-5 font-display text-[19px] font-semibold tracking-tight text-pearl\">Private by default</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[14px] leading-[1.75] text-mist\">Emails, full birth dates, last names, and account provider details stay out of discovery cards and public surfaces.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv \" style=\"--rv-delay:240ms\"><div class=\"group h-full rounded-[22px] border hairline bg-abyss/60 p-7 transition-all duration-500 hover:border-ember/30 hover:bg-abyss\"><div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border hairline bg-night transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:-translate-y-1\"><svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 26 26\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 8h18M4 13h18M4 18h18\" stroke=\"#d9a752\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"8\" r=\"2.2\" fill=\"#0a0d18\" stroke=\"#4fb8a7\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"></circle><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"13\" r=\"2.2\" fill=\"#0a0d18\" stroke=\"#4fb8a7\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"></circle><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2.2\" fill=\"#0a0d18\" stroke=\"#4fb8a7\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-5 font-display text-[19px] font-semibold tracking-tight text-pearl\">Discovery controls</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[14px] leading-[1.75] text-mist\">Tune age range, distance, shown genders, intentions, verified-only discovery — and whether you are discoverable at all.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-24\"><div class=\"rv \" style=\"--rv-delay:0ms\"><div class=\"rule-ember mb-12\"></div><p class=\"eyebrow\">The community standard</p></div><div class=\"mt-8 grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"rv \" style=\"--rv-delay:0ms\"><div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-3\"><span class=\"font-display text-[13px] italic text-ember\">01</span><h3 class=\"font-display text-[19px] font-semibold tracking-tight text-pearl\">Honor health autonomy</h3></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-[14px] leading-[1.75] text-mist\">Members are free to make informed choices about their bodies, homes, food, family, and care. Compatibility starts with respect.</p></div><div class=\"rv \" style=\"--rv-delay:100ms\"><div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-3\"><span class=\"font-display text-[13px] italic text-ember\">02</span><h3 class=\"font-display text-[19px] font-semibold tracking-tight text-pearl\">Be recognizable and real</h3></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-[14px] leading-[1.75] text-mist\">Recent photos, honest details, a bio that sounds like you. A profile should feel like an invitation into your values — not a performance.</p></div><div class=\"rv \" style=\"--rv-delay:200ms\"><div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-3\"><span class=\"font-display text-[13px] italic text-ember\">03</span><h3 class=\"font-display text-[19px] font-semibold tracking-tight text-pearl\">Move toward commitment with care</h3></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-[14px] leading-[1.75] text-mist\">Pass respectfully, like intentionally, and open with something specific. Freeborn rewards attention and patience over impulse.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"why-freeborn\" class=\"relative border-t hairline bg-gradient-to-b from-night via-midnight/25 to-night\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 lg:py-32\"><div class=\"rv mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center\" style=\"--rv-delay:0ms\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Why Freeborn</p><h2 class=\"mt-5 font-display text-[clamp(2rem,4.2vw,3.4rem)] font-semibold leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.02em] text-pearl\">Built on what the other apps<!-- --> <em class=\"font-medium italic text-gold-soft\">got wrong.</em></h2><p class=\"mt-6 text-[16px] leading-[1.8] text-mist\">We read the reviews of the other unvaccinated-focused apps. The scams, the broken filters, the paywalls, the dead profiles. Freeborn is built to fix every one of them — and we only promise what we actually ship.</p></div><div class=\"mt-14 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"rv \" style=\"--rv-delay:0ms\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-[24px] border border-white/[0.07] bg-white/[0.025] p-6 transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-white/[0.15]\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><span class=\"flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[var(--color-ember-500)]/12 text-[var(--color-ember-300)]\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3l7.5 3v5.2c0 4.8-3.2 8.1-7.5 9.8-4.3-1.7-7.5-5-7.5-9.8V6L12 3z\"></path><path d=\"M9 11.8l2.1 2.1L15.4 9\"></path></svg></span><div><p class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold italic leading-5 text-[var(--color-ash)]\">Fake profiles &amp; romance scams run rampant</p><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[15px] font-medium leading-[1.65] text-[var(--color-ivory)]\">Photo verification with a visible trust badge, and profiles that show real detail — so you can tell a real person from a script.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"rv \" style=\"--rv-delay:80ms\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-[24px] border border-white/[0.07] bg-white/[0.025] p-6 transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-white/[0.15]\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><span class=\"flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[var(--color-ember-500)]/12 text-[var(--color-ember-300)]\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 6h16M7 12h10M10 18h4\"></path></svg></span><div><p class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold italic leading-5 text-[var(--color-ash)]\">Filters that don&#x27;t work — wrong age, wrong distance, wrong gender</p><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[15px] font-medium leading-[1.65] text-[var(--color-ivory)]\">Filters that actually filter: age, distance, gender, vaccination stance, religion, kids, drinking, smoking, and language.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"rv \" style=\"--rv-delay:0ms\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-[24px] border border-white/[0.07] bg-white/[0.025] p-6 transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-white/[0.15]\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><span class=\"flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[var(--color-ember-500)]/12 text-[var(--color-ember-300)]\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 109-9\"></path><path d=\"M3 4v5h5\"></path><path d=\"M9.5 9.5l5 5M14.5 9.5l-5 5\"></path></svg></span><div><p class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold italic leading-5 text-[var(--color-ash)]\">People you passed keep showing back up</p><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[15px] font-medium leading-[1.65] text-[var(--color-ivory)]\">Pass is final. When you pass someone, they stay passed — no recycling, no re-showing.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"rv \" style=\"--rv-delay:80ms\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-[24px] border border-white/[0.07] bg-white/[0.025] p-6 transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-white/[0.15]\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><span class=\"flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[var(--color-ember-500)]/12 text-[var(--color-ember-300)]\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"6\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2.5\"></rect><path d=\"M3 10h18\"></path><path d=\"M7 15h4\"></path></svg></span><div><p class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold italic leading-5 text-[var(--color-ash)]\">Paywalls after a few likes — pay to do anything</p><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[15px] font-medium leading-[1.65] text-[var(--color-ivory)]\">Free to match, chat, send photos and voice notes. No paywall hiding the basics.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"rv \" style=\"--rv-delay:0ms\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-[24px] border border-white/[0.07] bg-white/[0.025] p-6 transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-white/[0.15]\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><span class=\"flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[var(--color-ember-500)]/12 text-[var(--color-ember-300)]\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 20h9\"></path><path d=\"M16.5 3.5a2.1 2.1 0 013 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4L16.5 3.5z\"></path></svg></span><div><p class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold italic leading-5 text-[var(--color-ash)]\">No way to edit your profile once it&#x27;s made</p><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[15px] font-medium leading-[1.65] text-[var(--color-ivory)]\">Full profile editing anytime — bio, photos, values, lifestyle, and every detail.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"rv \" style=\"--rv-delay:80ms\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-[24px] border border-white/[0.07] bg-white/[0.025] p-6 transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-white/[0.15]\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><span class=\"flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[var(--color-ember-500)]/12 text-[var(--color-ember-300)]\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"10.5\" width=\"14\" height=\"9.5\" rx=\"2.5\"></rect><path d=\"M8 10.5V8a4 4 0 018 0v2.5\"></path></svg></span><div><p class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold italic leading-5 text-[var(--color-ash)]\">Fear the app is tracking or exposing your status</p><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[15px] font-medium leading-[1.65] text-[var(--color-ivory)]\">Your vaccination stance is shown only as a badge you control. Your email, birth date, and exact location are never public.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"rv \" style=\"--rv-delay:0ms\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-[24px] border border-white/[0.07] bg-white/[0.025] p-6 transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-white/[0.15]\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><span class=\"flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[var(--color-ember-500)]/12 text-[var(--color-ember-300)]\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 8.4a6 6 0 10-12 0c0 6.6-2.7 8.4-2.7 8.4h17.4S18 15 18 8.4z\"></path><path d=\"M13.7 20a2 2 0 01-3.4 0\"></path></svg></span><div><p class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold italic leading-5 text-[var(--color-ash)]\">Notifications say you were liked but you can&#x27;t see who</p><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[15px] font-medium leading-[1.65] text-[var(--color-ivory)]\">Real notifications that show who liked you, so you can actually act on them.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"rv \" style=\"--rv-delay:80ms\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-[24px] border border-white/[0.07] bg-white/[0.025] p-6 transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-white/[0.15]\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><span class=\"flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[var(--color-ember-500)]/12 text-[var(--color-ember-300)]\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"5\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2.5\"></rect><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3.4\"></circle></svg></span><div><p class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold italic leading-5 text-[var(--color-ash)]\">Invasive biometric verification that collects your data</p><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[15px] font-medium leading-[1.65] text-[var(--color-ivory)]\">Optional photo verification that stays private. No face-scanning, no biometric harvesting.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"rv \" style=\"--rv-delay:140ms\"><div class=\"mt-14 text-center\"><a href=\"/auth?mode=sign-up\" class=\"btn-ember btn-shine relative inline-flex overflow-hidden rounded-full px-9 py-4 text-[16px] font-bold\">Join Freeborn free</a><p class=\"mt-4 text-[12px] text-[var(--color-ash)]\">No paywall. No fake profiles. No recycled matches.</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"faq\" class=\"relative border-t hairline\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-12 px-5 py-28 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] lg:gap-20 lg:py-36\"><div class=\"rv lg:sticky lg:top-32 lg:self-start\" style=\"--rv-delay:0ms\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Questions, answered</p><h2 class=\"mt-5 font-display text-[clamp(2rem,4.2vw,3.4rem)] font-semibold leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.02em] text-pearl\">Honest answers,<!-- --> <em class=\"font-medium italic text-gold-soft\">no fine print.</em></h2><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-[1.8] text-mist\">If something isn&#x27;t answered here, it probably isn&#x27;t in the product yet — and we&#x27;d rather say that plainly than dress it up.</p></div><div><div class=\"rv \" style=\"--rv-delay:0ms\"><details class=\"faq group border-t hairline\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-6 py-6\"><span class=\"font-display text-[18px] font-medium tracking-tight text-pearl transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-gold-soft\">Who is Freeborn for?</span><span class=\"faq-plus flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border hairline text-sand\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 1v10M1 6h10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></span></summary><div class=\"faq-body overflow-hidden\"><p class=\"pb-7 pr-12 text-[15px] leading-[1.8] text-mist\">Freeborn is for values-aligned singles who care about medical freedom, natural health, informed choice, and intentional long-term relationships. It is for people who want compatibility to include how they live, heal, build family, and make decisions.</p></div></details></div><div class=\"rv \" style=\"--rv-delay:50ms\"><details class=\"faq group border-t hairline\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-6 py-6\"><span class=\"font-display text-[18px] font-medium tracking-tight text-pearl transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-gold-soft\">Is Freeborn only for people with the exact same health views?</span><span class=\"faq-plus flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border hairline text-sand\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 1v10M1 6h10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></span></summary><div class=\"faq-body overflow-hidden\"><p class=\"pb-7 pr-12 text-[15px] leading-[1.8] text-mist\">No. Freeborn is not a purity test. It is a relationship platform for people who value autonomy, respectful conversation, natural living, and long-term clarity. Members decide which values are essential for them.</p></div></details></div><div class=\"rv \" style=\"--rv-delay:100ms\"><details class=\"faq group border-t hairline\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-6 py-6\"><span class=\"font-display text-[18px] font-medium tracking-tight text-pearl transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-gold-soft\">How is Freeborn different from other dating apps?</span><span class=\"faq-plus flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border hairline text-sand\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 1v10M1 6h10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></span></summary><div class=\"faq-body overflow-hidden\"><p class=\"pb-7 pr-12 text-[15px] leading-[1.8] text-mist\">Freeborn emphasizes full profiles, clear intentions, finite discovery, privacy-minded onboarding, and compatibility around values like health autonomy and natural wellness. It is built around deciding with context instead of reacting to a stack.</p></div></details></div><div class=\"rv \" style=\"--rv-delay:150ms\"><details class=\"faq group border-t hairline\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-6 py-6\"><span class=\"font-display text-[18px] font-medium tracking-tight text-pearl transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-gold-soft\">Is Freeborn free?</span><span class=\"faq-plus flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border hairline text-sand\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 1v10M1 6h10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></span></summary><div class=\"faq-body overflow-hidden\"><p class=\"pb-7 pr-12 text-[15px] leading-[1.8] text-mist\">The current product lets members create a profile, discover people, like, match, and message — without advertising a paid plan or an invented upgrade promise.</p></div></details></div><div class=\"rv \" style=\"--rv-delay:200ms\"><details class=\"faq group border-t hairline\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-6 py-6\"><span class=\"font-display text-[18px] font-medium tracking-tight text-pearl transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-gold-soft\">What information is public?</span><span class=\"faq-plus flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border hairline text-sand\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 1v10M1 6h10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></span></summary><div class=\"faq-body overflow-hidden\"><p class=\"pb-7 pr-12 text-[15px] leading-[1.8] text-mist\">Discovery surfaces profile details such as display name, age, city, region, occupation, bio, intentions, interests, lifestyle, photos, and verification status. Email, full birth date, and account provider details are never shown publicly.</p></div></details></div><div class=\"rv \" style=\"--rv-delay:250ms\"><details class=\"faq group border-t hairline\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-6 py-6\"><span class=\"font-display text-[18px] font-medium tracking-tight text-pearl transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-gold-soft\">How do you build trust without overpromising?</span><span class=\"faq-plus flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border hairline text-sand\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 1v10M1 6h10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></span></summary><div class=\"faq-body overflow-hidden\"><p class=\"pb-7 pr-12 text-[15px] leading-[1.8] text-mist\">By showing what the product actually supports today: age-gated onboarding, editable privacy controls, discoverability settings, verification status, profile completeness cues, and clear member standards.</p></div></details></div><div class=\"border-t hairline\"></div></div></div></section><section class=\"relative overflow-hidden border-t hairline\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-64 left-1/2 h-[640px] w-[1000px] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(closest-side, rgba(239,94,94,0.16), rgba(217,167,82,0.07) 55%, transparent 75%)\"></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-28 sm:px-8 lg:py-36\"><div class=\"rv \" style=\"--rv-delay:0ms\"><div class=\"surface magic-border relative overflow-hidden rounded-[48px] p-10 text-center shadow-[var(--shadow-card-lg)] sm:p-16\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -right-20 -top-20 h-80 w-80 rounded-full opacity-60 blur-[90px]\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(217,167,82,0.22), transparent 70%)\"></div><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-24 -left-20 h-80 w-80 rounded-full opacity-50 blur-[90px]\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(239,94,94,0.2), transparent 70%)\"></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto flex max-w-2xl flex-col items-center\"><div class=\"relative flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center\" style=\"width:64px;height:64px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"pulse-glow absolute inset-0 rounded-[32%]\" style=\"background: